## DEAL CONTRIBUTIONS TO CREATE (1 row)

**DEAL CONTRIBUTIONS TO CREATE:** create one Deal Contribution (record type Unlocked) per row with SE_Name__c \`005PLACEHOLDER0001\`. Opportunity is the opportunity's name, for you to read; Opportunity__c is its Id; set Opportunity_Role__c and Split_Percentage__c as given, and Comments__c exactly as given, with every ⏎ replaced by a line break. If the owner already has a DC on that opportunity, update its Comments__c and Split_Percentage__c instead of creating a second one.

