## EVENTS TO UPDATE (2 rows)

**EVENTS TO UPDATE:** each row changes one field on an existing Event: on the record whose Id is in Record Id, set the field named in Field to New value, nothing else. When Field is Delete, delete that Event **only after** the replacement row named in the Why column exists in Org62. Current value (what Org62 held when this was written) and Why are for you to read: never write them anywhere.

